WEBVTT

00:04:57.958 --> 00:05:01.184
responsibility for one another.

00:05:01.208 --> 00:05:05.643
In this regard, I'm no different
from my fellow Belarusians.

00:05:05.667 --> 00:05:08.184
Their support is tangible.

00:05:08.208 --> 00:05:11.976
Their solidarity grows in progression.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.768
When there are two of you,

00:05:13.792 --> 00:05:15.518
you are daring.

00:05:15.542 --> 00:05:17.875
When you're 100, you are brave.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:20.851
When there are thousands of you,

00:05:20.875 --> 00:05:22.559
you are fearless.

00:05:22.583 --> 00:05:25.559
And once you are tens of thousands,

00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:28.393
you become invincible.

00:05:28.417 --> 00:05:29.667
Thank you.